    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14777" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῆς</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργᾶς</span></b>  (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄργας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AB</u>
					442
				</span></i>
			), ὁ, a kind of <i>serpent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Achae.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				199
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφις ἀργῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					5.86
				</span></i>
			: also an obscure nickname of Demosthenes, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
